# Base URL for the backend API. Falls back to the shared dev deployment if
# unset; see docs/API_REQUIREMENTS.md for what that API does and doesn't
# implement. In dev this is normally left empty so requests go same-origin
# through the Vite proxy (vite.config.ts), which works around the backend's
# missing CORS headers.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://tms-api-m7yf.onrender.com
